## Consolidated Recommendations

### Security & Configuration
- Move Supabase URL/key and other credentials to env. Validate at runtime via settings.ts; add .env.example; rotate exposed keys.
- Enable and enforce RLS on images/prompts; choose a write strategy:
  - Option A (demo/safer): Anonymous reads only; route writes via Edge Function with service role.
  - Option B (full auth): Supabase Auth; ownership policies per user.
- Replace window.confirm with reusable confirmation dialogs that capture intent; add basic audit logging.

### Architecture & State Management
- Split Prompts/Gallery into subcomponents (grid/list/cards, filters, bulk actions, pagination, dialogs).
- Extract shared hooks and components for filters, pagination, selection, and toolbars.
- Migrate cross-page UI state to a predictable store (e.g., Zustand slices); keep server state in React Query.

### Data & API Layer
- Create Supabase data services with selective columns, typed responses, and pagination helpers; remove redundant client-side sorting when DB is ordered.
- Batch expensive operations; add throttling, AbortController support, and limited retries with backoff for generation.
- Consolidate storage strategy; prefer single backend (e.g., Supabase Storage or keep Firebase but remove inline base64). Store URLs in DB, not blobs.

### Type Safety, Error Handling, Logging
- Enable TS strict mode and related safeguards; fix resulting type errors incrementally.
- Implement ErrorBoundary wrapper and a centralized logger with levels; remove raw console.* in production code.
- Standardize API result types and user-friendly error toasts.

### Performance & UX
- Add TanStack Virtual (or equivalent) for prompt/image grids; add skeleton loaders and lazy loading.
- Introduce targeted DB indexes for frequent filters/sorts (created_at, theme, country, continent, year, cost, real_event, approx_people_count, confidence, optimized_url IS NOT NULL).
- Offload image conversions to a Web Worker (OffscreenCanvas when available). Fix pipeline to reliably set ready=true after uploads/variants.
- Redesign FiltersPanel into collapsible sections; improve mobile discoverability and keyboard navigation.

### Documentation & DevEx
- Align docs to Vite + React Router and real routing; unify dev port setting.
- Clean package managers; standardize on pnpm (as pinned); remove unused dependencies (e.g., next).
- Add Vitest + Testing Library and Playwright smoke tests; add CI with lint/build/test.

