## Improvement Roadmap (Phased)

### Immediate (0–2 weeks)
- Secure secrets: move Supabase keys to env; add .env.example; runtime validation; rotate if exposed.
- Lock down data access: enable RLS; adopt Option A (anonymous read-only; route writes via Edge Function) or begin Option B (Auth) groundwork.
- Stabilize errors and confirmations: add ErrorBoundary + logger; replace window.confirm with shared confirmation dialog.
- Repo hygiene: remove unused next, clean non-pnpm lockfiles, unify dev port setting with README; update routing/docs; remove obsolete Tasks route.
- Quick UX wins: skeleton loaders for lists; basic lazy loading of images; consistent toasts.

### Near Term (2–6 weeks)
- Modularize Prompts/Gallery into subcomponents; extract shared hooks (filters, selection, pagination) and shared UI primitives.
- Data service layer: selective columns, typed helpers, pagination utilities, request de-dupe.
- Performance: introduce virtualization, add DB indexes, remove client re-sorting when DB returns ordered results.
- Pipeline fixes: set ready=true after successful uploads/variants; add abort/retry; throttle bulk generation.
- Testing baseline: Vitest + Testing Library; Playwright smoke tests for prompt→generate→gallery flow.
- Accessibility: improve FiltersPanel keyboard/focus behavior; mobile-friendly drawer/sheet variant.

### Long Term (6+ weeks)
- Asynchronous generation pipeline: background jobs (Supabase Edge Functions) for conversions/uploads/variants.
- Advanced observability: metrics (generation time, Supabase latency), structured logs, alerting.
- Storage consolidation finalized; remove inline binary column once migration completes.
- Feature growth: saved prompt templates, team/multi-tenancy, cost dashboards.

