## Quick Wins
- Replace window.confirm with shared confirmation dialog for destructive actions.
- Remove obsolete routes/dependencies and backup config files.
- Add skeleton cards during prompt/gallery fetch to smooth perceived performance.
- Add ESLint rule or logger wrapper to curb production console noise.
- Document mobile filter usage; consider a sheet/drawer variant for small screens.

## Success Metrics / KPIs
- Bundle size <1.5 MB; Lighthouse scores ≥90.
- Test coverage ≥70%; TypeScript strict mode with zero errors.
- <3s initial load; <200ms median API response.
- Zero console errors in production; reliable ready=true state after generation.

## Acceptance Criteria for “Improved” State
- Anonymous users cannot mutate tables; reads still work.
- Dev server/documentation mismatch resolved; repository standardized on pnpm.
- Tests run with Vitest; Playwright smoke test passes for prompt→generate→gallery.
- Image generation marks ready=true upon completion; Gallery reflects that.
- No inline base64 blobs written to DB; images stored in object storage with URLs only.

